config SND_SOC_ATH79
	tristate "SoC Audio for the Atheros AR9331 SoC"
	depends on ATH79
	select SND_SOC_GENERIC_DMAENGINE_PCM
	help
	  Say Y or M if you want to add support for the I2S audio
	  interface (stereo block + MBOX DMA) of the Atheros AR9331 SoC.
	  This was originally based on the Qualcomm ath79-stereo BSP
	  code and franzflasch's ar9331-i2s-alsa Carambola2 driver,
	  ported to the modern ASoC component API.
